# Reject credentials/artifacts even within an allowed source directory.
**/.env*
**/.postgres.local
**/node_modules/**
**/backups/**
**/logs/**
**/signing-private/**
**/*.log
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.key
**/key.pem
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.exe
**/*.blockmap
